{
  "@context": {
    "schema": "https://schema.org/"
  },
  "@type": "Note",
  "@id": "note:notion-56",
  "title": "Privacy Policy",
  "author": "person:jane-brew:001",
  "status": "draft",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Privacy Policy"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Privacy Policy for Docket"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Welcome to Docket, your digital TV guide for the internet. This privacy policy outlines the types of information we collect from you while you use our application, and how we use that information."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-4",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Information Collection"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Personal Information:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "We collect personal information when you sign up for our service, such as your name, email address, and preferences."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Usage Data:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-8",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "We collect data on how you interact with our services, which helps us improve features and user experience."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-9",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Cookies and Tracking:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-10",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "We use cookies to manage sessions and to enhance user experience. You can opt out of cookies through your browser settings, but this may affect the functionality of our services."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-11",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Use of Information"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-12",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The information we collect is used in the following ways:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-20",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-13",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "To provide and maintain our service"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-14",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "To notify you about changes to our service"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-15",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "To allow you to participate in interactive features when you choose to do so"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-16",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "To provide customer support"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-17",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "To gather analysis or valuable information so that we can improve our service"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-18",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "To monitor the usage of our service"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-19",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "To detect, prevent and address technical issues"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-21",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Information Sharing"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-22",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "We do not sell, trade, or otherwise transfer to outside parties your Personally Identifiable Information unless we provide users with advance notice. This does not include website hosting partners and other parties who assist us in operating our website, conducting our business, or serving our users, so long as those parties agree to keep this information confidential."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-23",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Security"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-24",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "We value your trust in providing us your Personal Information, thus we are striving to use commercially acceptable means of protecting it. But remember that no method of transmission over the internet, or method of electronic storage is 100% secure and reliable, and we cannot guarantee its absolute security."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-25",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Changes to This Privacy Policy"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-26",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "We may update our Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you of any changes by posting the new Privacy Policy on this page. You are advised to review this Privacy Policy periodically for any changes."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-27",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Contact Us"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-28",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "If you have any questions or suggestions about our Privacy Policy, do not hesitate to contact us at [privacy@docket.tv](mailto:privacy@docket.tv)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-29",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "This policy is effective as of April 21st, 2024."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}